          "value_raw": "As per major perilous demesne (see below), except up to six hazards, each of CR 10 or less, imperil creatures in the area. The hazards are arranged so that if any are encountered together, the encounter’s effective CR from hazards must be no more than 11 (for instance, two CR 9 hazards could be encountered together).",
