  "description": {
    "raw": "By touching the ground, you curse the land with six unnatural hazards. This functions as lesser curse terrain, but with the effects of the greater perilous demesne curse (see page 145).Perilous Demesne, GreaterType regional curse; Area 6-mile-radius emanation; Save Will DC 19 to remove\n\nEffect As per major perilous demesne (see below), except up to six hazards, each of CR 10 or less, imperil creatures in the area. The hazards are arranged so that if any are encountered together, the encounter’s effective CR from hazards must be no more than 11 (for instance, two CR 9 hazards could be encountered together).\n\nCure Remove curse removes a greater perilous demesne only if followed by a casting of hallow at the effect’s center.",
    "search_text": "\"by touching the ground, you curse the land with six unnatural hazards. this functions as lesser curse terrain, but with the effects of the greater perilous demesne curse (see page 145).perilous demesne, greatertype regional curse; area 6-mile-radius emanation; save will dc 19 to remove\\n\\neffect as per major perilous demesne (see below), except up to six hazards, each of cr 10 or less, imperil creatures in the area. the hazards are arranged so that if any are encountered together, the encounter’s effective cr from hazards must be no more than 11 (for instance, two cr 9 hazards could be encountered together).\\n\\ncure remove curse removes a greater perilous demesne only if followed by a casting of hallow at the effect’s center.\"",
    "sections": []
  },
